* One set-bit iteration of the multiplication at the machine (Lean ` mulBody ` , the ` ite ` 's true branch): ` dup x t s ` copies the shifted multiplicand onto ` t ` (~ tmcdup ), ` add w t s w ` adds it into the accumulator in place (~ tmcaddx ); ` t ` and ` s ` are restored, so the composite updates the accumulator's stack only.

